WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.967
- [Narrator] Every night,
countless people wake up

00:00:02.967 --> 00:00:04.777
unable to move.

00:00:04.777 --> 00:00:07.627
Their minds and bodies in the
throes of a real condition

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:10.350
called sleep paralysis.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:13.185
When triggered, the
symptoms are usually mild.

00:00:13.185 --> 00:00:16.287
From tense muscles, to labored breathing.

00:00:16.287 --> 00:00:19.953
But for some, the experience
conjures hallucinations

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:23.027
that make nightmares come alive.

00:00:23.027 --> 00:00:24.927
Here are some of their stories.

00:00:24.927 --> 00:00:27.427
(eerie music)

00:00:32.842 --> 00:00:34.518
- [Sean] Before I learned to cope with it

00:00:34.518 --> 00:00:37.284
I've seen quite a few awful things.

00:00:37.284 --> 00:00:40.250
Horror films don't
really, they don't really

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.635
do anything for me anymore

00:00:41.635 --> 00:00:45.887
because what I've seen is more terrifying.

00:00:45.887 --> 00:00:47.240
The earliest I can remember

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.453
is seeing a figure that
looked like my mother

00:00:49.453 --> 00:00:50.962
sitting on my bed.

00:00:50.962 --> 00:00:55.129
Uh, her face is then morphing
into some kind of demon.

00:00:57.479 --> 00:00:59.379
Another time, a little
girl was in the corner

00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:00.962
just staring at me.

00:01:02.876 --> 00:01:05.666
Then without notice,
she shrieks and runs up

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:08.439
and grabs me by the neck.

00:01:08.439 --> 00:01:09.987
You try to call for help

00:01:09.987 --> 00:01:12.489
but your voice, it doesn't work

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:14.822
and your body won't respond.

00:01:16.116 --> 00:01:18.033
You just feel helpless.

00:01:22.266 --> 00:01:23.740
- [Joo] On one particular night,

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:26.079
I felt like someone was looking at me

00:01:26.079 --> 00:01:27.752
from the foot of my bed.

00:01:27.752 --> 00:01:29.279
I knew that nothing was there

00:01:29.279 --> 00:01:31.829
but I was afraid to open my eyes.

00:01:31.829 --> 00:01:34.496
When I did, I saw a woman's head

00:01:35.852 --> 00:01:38.652
looking straight back at me.

00:01:38.652 --> 00:01:41.004
She didn't have a body or even a neck.

00:01:41.004 --> 00:01:42.891
Just her head.

00:01:42.891 --> 00:01:46.612
I still remember the
smirk she had on her face.

00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:48.126
I closed my eyes immediately

00:01:48.126 --> 00:01:50.209
and I was unable to move.

00:01:51.213 --> 00:01:55.213
When I felt it was safe,
I opened my eyes again.

00:01:57.076 --> 00:01:59.576
(eerie music)

00:02:06.197 --> 00:02:07.362
She was still there.

00:02:07.362 --> 00:02:10.434
And she began to laugh at me.

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:14.676
I closed my eyes again,
hoping she would disappear.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.759
Then, I heard this scoff.

00:02:18.326 --> 00:02:19.743
And she was gone.

00:02:24.474 --> 00:02:26.266
- [Nicholas] So, I remember waking up

00:02:26.266 --> 00:02:29.152
and feeling a presence in the room.

00:02:29.152 --> 00:02:31.552
And I see this woman in a black dress

00:02:31.552 --> 00:02:33.752
looming above the floor.

00:02:33.752 --> 00:02:36.252
And she kept coming
closer and closer to me.

00:02:36.252 --> 00:02:37.876
I could feel my throat closing

00:02:37.876 --> 00:02:39.793
and I couldn't breathe.

00:02:40.816 --> 00:02:43.182
As soon as she made it towards me

00:02:43.182 --> 00:02:44.930
she floated right in front of my face

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.542
and started screaming.

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:48.692
(eerie music)

00:02:48.692 --> 00:02:50.456
I bolted out of my bed

00:02:50.456 --> 00:02:52.806
and I tried to wake up my parents.

00:02:52.806 --> 00:02:54.682
Little did I know, I was still dreaming

00:02:54.682 --> 00:02:56.456
and I ended up back in my bed

00:02:56.456 --> 00:02:58.969
in another sleep paralysis experience.

00:02:58.969 --> 00:03:02.581
It's something that's so wild and surreal

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:04.914
that there's no logic to it.

00:03:06.506 --> 00:03:08.256
- [Narrator] So if you wake up one day

00:03:08.256 --> 00:03:10.803
paralyzed by horrific visions

00:03:10.803 --> 00:03:12.830
remember to stay calm.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.446
And understand that your nightmares

00:03:14.446 --> 00:03:17.082
are only as real as you make them.

00:03:17.082 --> 00:03:19.665
(wind blowing)

